{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42147","headline":"贺殷游二舍人入翰林江给事拜中丞 · 徐铉","name":"贺殷游二舍人入翰林江给事拜中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨待漏独徘徊，霄汉悬心不易裁。\n阁老深严归翰苑，夕郎威望拜霜台。\n青绫对覆蓬壶晚，赤棒前驱道路开。\n犹有西垣厅记在，莫忘同草紫泥来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}